# Line endings, stated once.
#
# The engine repository learned this the hard way: a file that drifts to CRLF
# shows up as a whole-file diff the first time somebody on another machine
# touches it, and the rule it breaks was written down and then ignored in one
# place. Source is LF everywhere, so a checkout behaves the same whatever
# wrote it.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries are not text and must never be converted. Godot's import cache and
# any compiled extension are the ones that matter here.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.pck binary
*.ttf binary
*.ogg binary
*.wav binary
